{"t":"329180.KS","n":"HD Hyundai Heavy Industries Co., Ltd.","nKo":"HD현대중공업","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":250500.0,"chg":12000.0,"chgPct":0.05031,"prev":238500.0,"dayH":253000.0,"dayL":243000.0,"w52H":765000.0,"w52L":235500.0,"vol":152320,"avgVol":241355,"mcap":26285661224960,"pe":null,"fpe":7.44,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":10080.0,"divY":0.0423,"beta":1.22,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Industrials","sKo":"산업재","i":"Aerospace & Defense","iKo":"항공우주 및 방위","city":"Ulsan","emp":null,"web":"https://www.hhi.co.kr","sum":"HD Hyundai Heavy Industries Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the shipbuilding business in South Korea, North America, Asia, Europe, and internationally. It operates through four segments: Shipbuilding, Offshore Plants, Engine Machinery, and Others. The company manufactures and sells general merchant ships, including container ships, tankers, ro-pax, ro-ro, and LNG bunkering vessels, as well as LNG, LPG, LEG, bulk, car, and petrochemical product carriers; special merchant ships, such as drillships, semi-submersible drilling rigs, and offshore support vessels; and naval and medium size ships comprising destroyer, frigate, submarine, patrol vessel, minelayer, and landing, combat support, and training ships. It also engages in the manufacturing and installation of fixed an","sumKo":"HD 현대중공업주식회사는 자회사들과 함께 한국, 북미, 아시아, 유럽 및 전 세계에서 조선 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 조선, 해양플랜트, 엔진 기계, 기타 등 4개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 당사는 컨테이너선, 탱커, 로팍스, 로로, LNG 벙커링선 등 일반 상선과 LNG, LPG, LEG, 벌크선, 자동차선, 석유화학제품 운반선 등을 제작, 판매하고 있습니다. 드릴십, 반잠수식 시추 장비, 해양 지원 선박 등의 특수 상선; 구축함, 호위함, 잠수함, 순찰함, 기뢰 부설함, 상륙함, 전투 지원함, 훈련함으로 구성된 해군 및 중형 선박이 포함됩니다. 또한 고정식 설비의 제조 및 설치에도 종사하고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":9045500000000,"ni":-352100000000},{"y":2023,"rev":11963900000000,"ni":24700000000},{"y":2024,"rev":14486500000000,"ni":621500000000},{"y":2025,"rev":17580600000000,"ni":1415500000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":51